20/extras/706d0e63955755e287d92b53d3ef05c0.webm?t=1746118962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235820/extras/706d0e63955755e287d92b53d3ef05c0.mp4?t=1746118962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spectacular graphics thanks to Unreal Engine 4</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FPS Survival Horror with ammo and first aid kit management</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Save points whenever you want in safe zones</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Variety of different scenarios </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several types of enemies </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tragic and macabre horror story </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game length 4 to 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2235820/extras/41880029aa591352c56fa39b3e769f81.avif?t=1746118962\" /></span> </p></li></ul>",
